# Claude Code — ignore local state, but DO share project skills and commands.
# `commands/` MUST stay shared: /startup and /shutdown are the Working Agreement
# checklists, and they are worthless if only one machine has them.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/

